{"availability":"available","full":"FareedKhan-dev/train-llm-from-scratch","name":"train-llm-from-scratch","description":"A straightforward method for training your LLM, from downloading data to generating text.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":12162,"forks":1702,"created":"2025-01-12T04:03:05Z","updated":"2026-10-02T14:45:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fareedkhan-dev.github.io/train-llm-from-scratch/","topics":["gemini","large-language-models","llm","openai","training","transformers"],"demo":"https://fareedkhan-dev.github.io/train-llm-from-scratch/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:56.770Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:56.770Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:56.770Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.220Z","stars":12025,"forks":1653},{"at":"2026-10-12T04:06:31.798Z","stars":12061,"forks":1660},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:16:56.770Z","stars":12162,"forks":1702}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["I am Looking for a PhD position in AI. GitHub","I implemented a transformer model from scratch using PyTorch, based on the paper Attention is All You Need. You can use my scripts to train your own billion or million parameter LLM using a single GPU, or a small one on a laptop CPU with no GPU at all.","This started as a pretraining tutorial. It now goes all the way from raw text to an aligned, reasoning style model, with every algorithm hand written in plain PyTorch (no trl, no peft, no transformers). The whole journey is one idea repeated: turn text into numbers, predict the next token, then keep changing the data and the loss until the model does what we want."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FareedKhan-dev/train-llm-from-scratch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d470466c0d6683232f4e821f4eaa5d750a833eb289ef91a8f353c8009b9334ac","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:36:32.360Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:56.841Z